{"slug": "membership-revenue-calculator", "title": "Studio Membership Revenue Calculator (Free)", "description": "Free calculator for dojos and studios: estimate monthly revenue, card processing and software costs, net per member and break-even member count.", "h1": "Studio membership revenue calculator", "keyword": "martial arts membership calculator", "type": "tool", "tools": [], "trades": ["martial", "bjj", "dance", "yoga"], "body": "<style>.calc{display:grid;gap:.6rem;max-width:560px}.calc label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:center}.calc input{width:9rem;padding:.35rem}.out{background:#f2f7f5;padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;margin:1rem 0}.out td{padding:.2rem .8rem .2rem 0}.ck li{margin:.35rem 0;list-style:none}.ck input{margin-right:.5rem}@media print{header,footer,.trust,.noprint{display:none}}</style><p>Estimate monthly studio revenue, what software and payment processing cost you, and the net per member. All math runs in your browser; nothing is sent anywhere. The starting values are placeholders, not industry averages. Replace them with your own numbers.</p><form class=\"calc\" id=\"c\" onsubmit=\"return false\"><label for=\"m\">Active members<input id=\"m\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"60\"></label><label for=\"p\">Average monthly membership price ($)<input id=\"p\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"120\"></label><label for=\"d\">Drop-in / class-pack sales per month ($)<input id=\"d\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"500\"></label><label for=\"o\">Other monthly revenue: retail, testing fees, events ($)<input id=\"o\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"0\"></label><label for=\"sw\">Software subscription ($/month)<input id=\"sw\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"99\"></label><label for=\"pp\">Card processing rate (%)<input id=\"pp\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"3\"></label><label for=\"pf\">Card fee per transaction ($)<input id=\"pf\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"0.3\"></label><label for=\"tx\">Card transactions per month<input id=\"tx\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"65\"></label><label for=\"rent\">Rent and other fixed costs ($/month)<input id=\"rent\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"0\"></label></form><div class=\"out\" aria-live=\"polite\"><table id=\"r\"></table></div><p class=\"note\">Check the processing rate in your processor or software contract. Most vendors don't publish one (see <a href=\"/martial-arts-software-pricing/\">software pricing by student count</a>). Formula: gross = members × price + drop-ins + other; processing = gross × rate + transactions × per-transaction fee; net = gross − software − processing − fixed costs.</p><script>(function(){var f=document.getElementById('c'),r=document.getElementById('r');function v(i){return parseFloat(document.getElementById(i).value)||0}function $(n){return '$'+n.toLocaleString(undefined,{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})}\nfunction calc(){var m=v('m'),g=m*v('p')+v('d')+v('o'),proc=g*v('pp')/100+v('tx')*v('pf'),fixed=v('sw')+v('rent'),net=g-proc-fixed,per=m?v('p'):0,perNet=per-(per*v('pp')/100+v('pf')),be=perNet>0?Math.ceil(fixed/perNet):'n/a';\nr.innerHTML='<tr><td>Gross monthly revenue</td><td><b>'+$(g)+'</b></td></tr><tr><td>Card processing</td><td>'+$(proc)+'</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>'+$(v('sw'))+'</td></tr><tr><td>Rent and fixed costs</td><td>'+$(v('rent'))+'</td></tr><tr><td>Net after these costs</td><td><b>'+$(net)+'</b></td></tr><tr><td>Software as % of gross</td><td>'+(g?(v('sw')/g*100).toFixed(1):'0')+'%</td></tr><tr><td>Net per member</td><td>'+(m?$(net/m):'n/a')+'</td></tr><tr><td>Annual net</td><td>'+$(net*12)+'</td></tr><tr><td>Members needed to cover software + fixed costs</td><td>'+be+'</td></tr>'}\nf.addEventListener('input',calc);calc()})();</script>", "faq": [["How is break-even calculated?", "Software plus fixed costs divided by what one member nets after card fees (membership price minus the percentage rate and per-transaction fee). It assumes one card transaction per member per month."], ["Does this calculator use industry benchmarks?", "No. The starting values are placeholders. Every result comes from the numbers you enter."], ["Is my data saved?", "No. The calculation runs entirely in your browser and nothing is sent or stored."]]}